1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:02,459
See this? An octopus.

2
00:00:02,459 --> 00:00:03,859
I was eleven.

3
00:00:03,859 --> 00:00:05,200
He lived under that rock

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,599
there, that one.

5
00:00:06,599 --> 00:00:07,360
Every day I put

6
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,640
my hand in, every

7
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,839
day he says no.

8
00:00:09,839 --> 00:00:11,179
One day I pull,

9
00:00:11,179 --> 00:00:12,099
he pulls,

10
00:00:12,099 --> 00:00:12,939
and I fall on my

11
00:00:12,939 --> 00:00:14,099
face on the rock.

12
00:00:14,099 --> 00:00:14,859
My mother cleaned

13
00:00:14,859 --> 00:00:16,379
it and called me

14
00:00:16,379 --> 00:00:18,079
stupid for a week.

15
00:00:18,079 --> 00:00:19,640
Eighty-three years later,

16
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:20,559
I think his grandson

17
00:00:20,559 --> 00:00:21,379
is still under there.

18
00:00:22,559 --> 00:00:24,140
The octopus won.

19
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,000
The sea always wins, amore,

20
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:26,920
so you respect it.

